        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Livaliza liu kutanga lia vandu va Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku liu kutanga liu mweli gwa kaviri, mu muhiga gwa kaviri, lwa vandu va Isiraeli vaali nivakatula Egebeti, Yahova yamoloma na Musa imbiri wi lihema lilie Liukuvuganira mu muchangalangwe cha Sinai. Yavoola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ivi harara na Haruni mulavaliza vandu va Isiraeli, kolondekana ni zihiiri kandi ni zinyumba ziavo. Ong'ode amita ga vasaza vosi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutangira ku mihiga 20, avaveeye avadukiru kutumika mu vulwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oteeve mwimiliri mulala munene kutura ku vuli ihiiri akokonye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaga na mita ga vimiliri vatovolwa kutura mu zihiiri kokora miyinzi yiji. Kutura mu ihiiri ya Rubeni yaali Elizuri muyaayi wa Shedeuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Simioni yaali Shelumieli muyaayi wa Zurishadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Yuda yaali Nashoni muyaayi wa Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Isakari yaali Nazaneli muyaayi wa Zuari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Zabuloni yaali Eliabu muyaayi wa Heloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu vana va Josefu, yatovola Efuraimu na Elishama muyaayi wa Amihudi; kutura mu ihiiri ya Manase yaali Gamalieli muyaayi wa Pedahizuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Benjamini yaali Abidani muyaayi wa Gidioni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutura mu ihiiri ya Dani yaali Ahiezeri muyaayi wa Amishadai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutura mu ihiiri ya Asheri yaali Pagieli muyaayi wa Okirani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutura mu ihiiri ya Gadi yaali Eliasafu muyaayi wa Duyeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutura mu ihiiri ya Nafutali yaali Ahira muyaayi wa Enani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yava nivo avatovolwa kutura mu muganda gwa aviimiliri vi zihiiri zia vaguuga vaavo vimiliri vi zihiiri zia Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa harara na Haruni vaavugura vandu yava, vamita gaavo gaali ni gang'odeywi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidiku liu kutanga liu mweli gwa kaviri, vavuganyia vandu vene yava vosi harara, kandi nivag'oda, vandu vosi kolondekana ni zihiiri ziavo na vababa vaavo kandi ni zinyumba ziavo. Kutura ku mihiga 20 kuzizagilira vang'odwa kandi nivavalizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuli Yahova yaali nalagi Musa. Kunangwa Musa yavaliza vandu vene yava vosi mwigendanyama lia Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Rubeni, waali wu kutanga ku vana va Yakobo, avasaza vosi avaari ni mihiga 20 kuzizagilira, avaari vanyara kuzia mu vulwani vang'odwa mita gaavo mulala sa mulala kolondekana ku ihiiri yaavo kandi zinyumba ziavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amita ga vasaza kutura mu ihiiri ya Rubeni vaali avandu 46,500. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura mu ihiiri ya Simioni, avasaza vosi avaari ni mihiga 20 kuzizagilira, avaari vanyara kuzia mu vulwani vaavalizwa kandi nivang'odwa mita gaavo mulala sa mulala kolondekana ni zihiiri ziavo kandi zinyumba ziavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vosi kutura mu ihiiri ya Simioni vaali 59,300. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
